288
00:17:40,080 --> 00:17:43,420
开萝尔∶你说过你想享受看着我们花这笔钱的乐趣,所以,
Carol: You said you wanted the pleasure of watching us spend it, so here;

289
00:17:43,420 --> 00:17:44,800
现在你看到了;我把钱给了旅行社.
I had the travel agent take it as I gave him the money.

290
00:17:44,800 --> 00:17:53,000
埃德∶我都不知道说什么好宝贝儿.
Ed: Oh.Honey I don't know what to say.

291
00:17:56,420 --> 00:17:59,100
开萝尔∶只是希望您二位在爱尔兰要小心...
Carol: I just want you two to be careful in Ireland because...

292
00:17:59,100 --> 00:18:01,420
因为他们车的行驶方向是刚好和我们相反的.
they drive on the other side of the road there.

293
00:18:01,740 --> 00:18:06,200
凯特∶哦,埃迪,这些年你一直在错误的国家开车.
Kate: Oh, Eddy, all these years you've been driving in the wrong country.

294
00:18:06,300 --> 00:18:08,900
本∶我不明白钱怎么可以让人变得像猪一样.
Ben: I don't understand how money turns people into pigs.

295
00:18:11,820 --> 00:18:14,880
杰森∶本,这是一个开始;让你明白钱改变了你.
Jason: Well, Ben that's a start; just to realise that money did change you.

296
00:18:15,080 --> 00:18:16,720
本∶不是我!是臭虫和加里.
Ben: Not me!Stinky and Gary.

297
00:18:17,680 --> 00:18:17,900
杰森∶本,那你告诉我,他们是怎么强迫你买这些东西的?
Jason: Ben, tell me just how did they force you to buy all these things?

298
00:18:17,900 --> 00:18:22,600
本∶强迫我!他们才不会那么笨!
Ben: Force me!They were very tricky about it.

299
00:18:22,600 --> 00:18:24,400
杰森∶看来都是你自愿的啦,对吗?
Jason: Well, they made it seem like your idea, right?

300
00:18:24,400 --> 00:18:25,800
本∶对.
Ben: Yeah.

301
00:18:28,780 --> 00:18:31,540
麦琪∶这就是原因,本,是你自己要买的.
Maggie: Well there's a reason for that, Ben...it was your idea.

302
00:18:33,340 --> 00:18:36,340
本∶你认为我是故意花掉5000美金的.
Ben: So, you think I blew five thousand Dollars on purpose.

303
00:18:36,660 --> 00:18:38,840
杰森∶不,我想你只是迷失了自己.
Jason: No, I think you probably just lost your head.

304
00:18:38,840 --> 00:18:42,700
本:我?你没有看到臭虫和加里像动物一样抢支票么?
Ben: Me?Didn't you see Stinky and Gary tug on that cheque like animals?

305
00:18:42,900 --> 00:18:44,720
麦琪∶知道,就像今天早上的你和迈克一样.
Maggie: Oh, kind of like you and Mike did, this morning.

306
00:18:44,940 --> 00:18:47,020
本∶哦!是!
Ben: Yeah.Oh!

307
00:18:48,980 --> 00:18:50,860
杰森∶本,你现在得到了一个很重要的认识.
Jason: You just had an important thought there, Ben.

308
00:18:51,120 --> 00:18:52,400
本∶那些东西让我害怕!我不仅花掉了5000美金,
Ben: I was afraid of that.

309
00:18:53,940 --> 00:18:57,380
我也犯下了错误.
So not only did I blow five thousand Dollars, I was wrong too.

310
00:18:57,680 --> 00:18:58,960
麦琪:说得对.
Maggie: That about sums it up.

311
00:18:59,500 --> 00:19:03,640
杰森∶本,接下来,你赢来的5000美金要怎么花呢?
Jason: So, Ben, what are we going to do with all your winnings?

312
00:19:04,240 --> 00:19:07,140
本∶你们可以再让我重新随意花一次.
Ben: Well, you could give me another shot to spend it any way I want.

313
00:19:07,140 --> 00:19:09,480
麦琪∶这是你真实的想法?
Maggie: Is that really what you think?

314
00:19:09,580 --> 00:19:11,980
本∶不是,我只是调节一下气氛而已.
Ben: No, I just figured we all need a good laugh about now.

315
00:19:13,880 --> 00:19:16,300
凯特∶麦琪!杰森!我们的外孙女用她的钱做了一件最美妙的事情.
Kate: Maggie!Jason!Our granddaughter just did the most wonderful thing with her money

316
00:19:16,300 --> 00:19:18,900
本∶不出所料.
Ben: It figures.

317
00:19:22,160 --> 00:19:24,260
开萝尔∶本,你很痛苦吗?
Carol: Ben, you're in pain, how sad.

318
00:19:25,220 --> 00:19:27,240
埃德∶她把我们送到国外去了.
Ed: She's sending us out of the country.

319
00:19:28,060 --> 00:19:30,200
杰森∶开萝尔,不错的主意.
Jason: Carol, that is a terrific idea.

320
00:19:31,320 --> 00:19:32,560
埃德∶你太有先见之明了.
Ed: You're so predictable.

321
00:19:32,560 --> 00:19:32,800
麦琪∶嗨!多学学你的姐姐.
Maggie: Hey, learn something from your sister.

322
00:19:35,460 --> 00:19:36,780
本∶什么?怎么吃饭吗?
Ben: What?How to eat.

323
00:19:39,420 --> 00:19:40,160
开萝尔∶那是什么?
Carol: What's that?

324
00:19:40,900 --> 00:19:43,220
麦琪∶你没买过车吧?
Maggie: You didn't buy a car too, did you?

325
00:19:43,220 --> 00:19:47,600
本∶我应该买的.
Ben: I might have.

326
00:19:47,600 --> 00:19:51,300
迈克∶Ta - da!!坦白说,你们觉得怎么样?
Mike: Ta-da!!Alright, alright, what do you think?Come on, be honest.

327
00:19:51,300 --> 00:19:54,900
杰森∶恩,最少你没有把钱全部花完.
Jason: Well...err...at least you didn't blow all your money at once.

328
00:19:58,120 --> 00:20:00,940
迈克∶什么意思,浪费我的钱?爸爸,这部车真的很不错的.
Mike: What do you mean, blow my money?Dad, this is a great car.

329
00:20:01,380 --> 00:20:02,780
麦琪∶他肯定一子不剩了.
Maggie: He spent every Dime.

330
00:20:02,780 --> 00:20:05,300
埃德∶等等,只等一分钟.迈克,这笔钱你花的开心吗?
Ed: Just wait a damn blooming minute.Mike, are you happy with the way you spent your money?

331
00:20:05,300 --> 00:20:08,800
迈克:爷爷,我从来没有这么高兴过.
Mike: Oh Grandpa, I have never been happier about anything in my whole life.

332
00:20:08,800 --> 00:20:11,900
埃德∶啊,那事情就结了!
Ed: Ah, then case closed!

333
00:20:11,900 --> 00:20:14,600
凯特∶啊我还没弄明白;他买什么了?
Kate: Ah, I don't get it; what did he buy?

334
00:20:14,600 --> 00:20:18,400
埃德∶车道上的一堆废铁.
Ed: The piece of junk in the drive-way.

335
00:20:22,320 --> 00:20:24,460
迈克:告诉你,当我把它拼起来的时候,
Mike: Hey, I'm telling you, once I fix this baby up,

336
00:20:24,460 --> 00:20:25,600
我都不认识它了.
you won't even recognize her.

337
00:20:25,720 --> 00:20:27,820
麦琪∶但是你没钱去装了呀.
Maggie: But you have no money left to fix it up with.

338
00:20:27,980 --> 00:20:29,820
迈克∶啊,零件!
Mike: Ah, details!Details!

339
00:20:30,720 --> 00:20:33,840
零件!我先拿去我们朋友们面前炫耀一下,马上回来.
Look, I'm gonna show this off to my friends, I'll see you later.

340
00:20:35,600 --> 00:20:39,100
麦琪∶哦!杰森,也值了,我不会在怪你了.
Maggie: Oh, Jason, for what it's worth, I don't blame you for this.

341
00:20:42,120 --> 00:20:43,520
杰森∶当然不,谁让他们是我们的孩子呢.
Jason: Of course not; we raised them.

342
00:20:43,660 --> 00:20:47,340
麦琪∶从好的方面看;开萝尔做了一件很漂亮的事情,本呢,
Maggie: Oh well look on the bright side; Carol did something nice,

343
00:20:47,340 --> 00:20:50,080
也得到了一些教训,虽然...
and Ben learned something inspite of himself and...

344
00:20:50,080 --> 00:20:52,920
杰森∶只有迈克还在延续他的没有责任感的完美记录.
Jason: And Mike continued his perfect record of irresponsibility.

345
00:20:53,340 --> 00:20:55,960
麦琪∶对,是完美记录.
Maggie: Well, it is a perfect record.

346
00:20:57,600 --> 00:21:01,400
佛瑞德∶打扰一下!请问迈克尔在家吗?
Fred: Ah, excuse me!Is Michael at home?

347
00:21:01,400 --> 00:21:03,900
麦琪∶啊,你刚好错过了.
Maggie: Ah, you just missed him.

348
00:21:07,340 --> 00:21:15,120
佛瑞德∶哦,讨厌!麻烦你们能不能把这个给他,
Fred: Oh drat!Well, would you give him these, for his new vehicle and...

349
00:21:15,160 --> 00:21:17,120
他的新车可能用得到的...哦,他还忘记拿走我的欠条了.
oh...he forgot my I-owe-you.

350
00:21:17,200 --> 00:21:21,000
麦琪∶3500美元!迈克给你...
Maggie: Thirty five hundred Dollars!Mike gave you...

351
00:21:24,040 --> 00:21:25,620
佛瑞德∶他什么都没有给我.
Fred: He didn't give me nothing.

352
00:21:26,340 --> 00:21:30,020
是一个短期贷款,等我从佛罗里达回来后,
I consider it merely as a short term loan,

353
00:21:30,020 --> 00:21:33,100
我会全额付还给他.
which I will repay in full as soon as I return from Florida.

354
00:21:33,100 --> 00:21:34,800
杰森∶哦,你还知道什么.
Jason: Well, what do you know.

355
00:21:37,840 --> 00:21:39,300
佛瑞德∶我听说那里很多女人都带牙套.
Fred: I hear they got a lot of women there with teeth.

356
00:21:39,300 --> 00:21:40,200
杰森∶牙套?
Jason: Teeth?

357
00:21:43,280 --> 00:21:47,160
佛瑞德∶恩,也许我还可以在那里为劳埃德找到好的伴侣呢.
Fred: Yeah.Maybe I'll even find a little Snouzer for Lloyd.

358
00:21:53,980 --> 00:21:57,280
麦琪∶这才是他的完美记录.杰森∶我从来都没有怀疑过我的儿子..
Maggie: Well, there goes his perfect record.

359
00:21:57,920 --> 00:21:59,780
00:21:55,200
Jason: I never doubted the boy for a minute
